@ForEverMyCrew (Follow GiGi for more Ever & Diesel dance footage... check out her feed for the KAR DANCE COMP duet!)

Kar Dance Competition: Ever and Diesel's duet placed first in their age category and 2nd in the "overalls" for ages 8 and under! This footage is from almost a year ago (2017) when Everleigh did a duet with Diesel ...and Ava came to cheer them on!  Everleigh and Diesel (both 4 years old at the time) were undefeated in 2017 for duets ages 6 and under and they placed in the overalls at every competition! 

 Dance Studio: @TheRage on instagram #RageNation -choreographer Tiffany Rojas (Diesel's mom).

Go watch Diesel (@DieselRojas on instagram) and his family on their YouTube channel!!!  YouTube:  ***The Diesel Ro Family Show***! 

Thanks for watching guys!! We love you!!  Comment below AND LIKE if you want us to post the actual routine from  KAR competition!

The besties fill up Valentine Bags to brighten the day of a a dozen homeless people in Orange County! Watch what Everleigh Soutas and Ava Foley choose to put in the  Valentine bags! Comment below and tell us what YOU would give to the homeless!  NOTE:  We will have 3 adults with us to insure that the besties stay safe while delivering the bags.  Don't talk to strangers!

See part two by clicking here:  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8oUm8sGPCQU&t=13s

Follow us on Instagram:
@Foreverandforava
