@EverleighRose

Thanks for watching guys! We love you!!

Hi guys! Thanks so much for watching our video! We had SO much fun turning into mermaids for the day with our favorite babies Taytum and Oakely! Thanks to @Once_Upon_An_Island for making our dreams come true! We have a really funny video coming out next Friday so stay tuned! Let us know in the comments what kinda of videos you guys want to see.. we might end up picking your idea!! Love you guys!

